 "notes": [
  "Posted 9 July 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "Starting cards in the post's 'Starting(6)' section: Ralltiir Operations, Ralltiir, Prepared Defenses, You Cannot Hide Forever, Imperial Arrest Order and Mobilization Points; they count toward the total.",
  "Total is 59 as published: the Characters header says 16 but lists 15 cards (3x AT-ST Pilot counted as three).",
  "Posted 'Grabber' names no card; it is printed as written (the post-Coruscant grabber Allegations Of Corruption is not yet out).",
  "Posted 'Coruscsant' dested Coruscant (Dark) (Special Edition); 'Kashyyyk', 'Ralltiir', 'Forest', 'Jungle' and 'SPC. Docking Bay' dested the Dark pages.",
  "Posted 'Darth Vader, DLOS' dested Darth Vader, Dark Lord Of The Sith; 'Darth Maul' and 'Maul's Saber' dested the Tatooine Darth Maul and Maul's Lightsaber; 'Moff Tarkin' dested Grand Moff Tarkin.",
  "Posted 'Dr.E + Ponda B' dested Dr. Evazan & Ponda Baba; '4-Lom WGun' dested 4-LOM With Concussion Rifle; 'Ig in 2000' dested IG-88 In IG-2000.",
  "Secret Plans and Oppressive Enforcement were Effects in 2001 (not Defensive Shields).",
  "The strategy (updated 12 October 2001) says the deck was built after Reflections II and is undefeated in the author's (unnamed) local tournament; it stays a general deck."
